{"id":"vod_lz_71686","vodId":"71686","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"哗鬼校园","name_cn":"哗鬼校园","date":"1997-01-01","year":"1997","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230920-1/5f928b09e665445049b3adba68069d24.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在齐东高中内，这看似是一间再普通不过的学校，可实际上，在校园里徘徊着七只幽灵，流传着七段非常恐怖的灵异传说。为了维持学校的正常运营，校董成立了圣徒会。北城遥都（有马克明 配音）是一个做梦都想过普通人生活的男生，但命运偏偏不放过他，他被校董任命成为了圣徒会的会长。　　除了北城遥都外，圣徒会的会员还有拥有极强灵感力的恋童癖巫女朝比奈睦月（仲间由纪惠 配音）和拥有附灵体质的和尚之子南堂和御（古本新之辅 配音）。他们所要应对的除了花子、二宫尊德、红斗篷假面等普通的幽灵外，还有一个隐藏的BOSS。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-20 07:42:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39173_6a00bbf3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39171_1d9f2837/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39175_e9191f35/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39174_6b2b651e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39176_b105b911/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39179_a1742ce2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39178_38b13228/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39177_60842427/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39180_cf2f22f4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39182_00051623/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39181_7521a3e6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz16.com/20230918/39183_675069ff/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.379Z"}